-- Juan "Chuy" Hinojosa / same-sex-marriage  (chair 3 -> 1, CHAIR_MOVED_HELD_SET_CLEARED)
UPDATE inform.politician_context SET reasoning = 'Chair moved from 3 to 1 on 2026-10-08 (migration 1906). Migration 1903 held this row out rather than repair it, because a citation repair may not move a chair and this member''s own record proves a rung the chair did not hold. The operator cleared the held set on 2026-10-08. 🔴 THE INSTRUMENT MIGRATION 1903 HELD THIS ROW ON WAS HIS OLDEST, AND HIS RECORD MOVED PAST IT. That instrument was SB 480 (83R, 2013), "the formation of a civil union between persons of the same sex", which reads as rung 4 -- civil unions instead of marriage. It was filed two years before Obergefell, when Texas still banned same-sex marriage by constitutional provision. EVERYTHING HE FILED AFTERWARDS IS RUNG 1, as author: SB 98 (84R), authorizing a marriage between two persons of the same sex and repealing the statutory prohibition; SJR 13 (84R), SJR 16 (85R) and SJR 9 (86R), constitutional amendments to repeal the provision restricting marriage to one man and one woman; SB 157 (85R), the conforming statutory changes; and SB 165 (85R), SB 38 (85 first called session) and SB 151 (86R), prohibiting discrimination based on sexual orientation or gender identity. ⚖ That is BOTH halves of Season 2 rung 1 -- equal marriage AND protection from discrimination -- filed repeatedly, under his own name, over four legislatures. Under the operator''s rule that THE LATEST FILING GOVERNS, this is rung 1 and the 2013 civil-union bill is superseded by his own later work rather than representative of it.', sources = ARRAY['https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=83R&Bill=SB480', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=84R&Bill=SB98', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=85R&Bill=SB157', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=85R&Bill=SB165', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=86R&Bill=SB151', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=86R&Bill=SJR9', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_%22Chuy%22_Hinojosa', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juan_Hinojosa']::text[], updated_at = now()
