UPDATE inform.politician_context SET reasoning = 'Blanked 2026-10-08 (migration 1906), and the reason RESTATED because the reason migration 1903 gave was wrong. 🔴 CORRECTING MIGRATION 1903, WHICH BLANKED THIS ROW BY MISTAKE. 1903 recorded it as a ladder-scope blank on the ground that the Season 2 rung at this value asks a different question from Season 1''s. THAT TEST WAS APPLIED TO THE WRONG PAIR OF RUNGS. Season 2 INSERTED a new rung 1 on this ladder -- "full legal equality: equal marriage plus protection from discrimination" -- and shifted the others down, remapping Season 1 rung 1 to Season 2 rung 2 (476 rows), Season 1 rung 2 to Season 2 rung 3 (143 rows) and blanking Season 1 rung 3, the federalism rung Season 2 does not contain (28 rows). This row ALREADY HAD a Season 2 answer at its remapped value, so it had been carried correctly long before this audit and no carry question existed for it; comparing Season 1 rung 2 against Season 2 rung 2 compared two different rungs. The chair is restored to where Season 2 already had it. ⚠ THIS ROW IS NOT RESTORED WITH THE OTHERS, because its own record argues a DIFFERENT rung from the one Season 2 holds and a chair move needs a decision, not a repair. THE RECORD: HB 1806 (88R), as coauthor, and HB 5031 (88R) and HB 2758 (89R) as author, the statutory changes recognising same-sex marriages and parenting relationships -- bills prohibiting discrimination on the basis of sexual orientation or gender identity. Season 2 rung 1 is the only rung that adds anti-discrimination protection to equal marriage, and this row already sat above the marriage threshold, so its own filings argue rung 1 rather than rung 3. It is left at 0 pending that decision rather than written at a chair its own evidence contradicts. The sources examined are kept below. This is a blank, not a deletion.', sources = ARRAY['https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=88R&Bill=HB1806', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=88R&Bill=HB5031', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/BillLookup/History.aspx?LegSess=89R&Bill=HB2758', 'https://capitol.texas.gov/Members/MemberInfo.aspx?Leg=89&Chamber=H&Code=A4120', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Bryant_(Texas_politician)']::text[], updated_at = now()
